Connecting ropes `4 3 2 6`:

| heap before | join | cost so far | heap after |
|---|---|---|---|
| 2 3 4 6 | 2 + 3 = 5 | 5 | 4 5 6 |
| 4 5 6 | 4 + 5 = 9 | 14 | 6 9 |
| 6 9 | 6 + 9 = 15 | **29** | 15 |

Joining in the given order instead (4 + 3, then + 2, then + 6) would cost 7 + 9 + 15 = 31.

